/A 1048 0 R
/Alt (The line graph displays percentage of baseline opening on the vertical axis from 0 to 100, and elapsed time in seconds on the horizontal axis from 0 to 8. Three data series are plotted. The Touch series starts at 100 percent, rapidly decreases to approximately 20 percent by 1.5 seconds, then remains stable. The Brands Fast series starts at 100 percent, rapidly decreases to approximately 20 percent by 2 seconds, then remains stable. The Brands Delayed series starts at 100 percent, decreases to approximately 60 percent by 2.5 seconds, then gradually decreases to approximately 25 percent by 7.5 seconds. A dotted horizontal line indicates 50 percent of baseline opening.)
/K 7
/P 28 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
